### Variabel Lingkungan (Sesuaikan dengan token uji tim kamu)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = token-uji-ayah
@token_ibu = token-uji-ibu
@token_anak = token-uji-anak
@household_id = id-rumah-ayah
@member_id = id-anggota-ayah

### 1. Uji 401: Tanpa Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/households
Authorization: Bearer 

### 2. Uji 200: Daftar Rumah Tangga (Dengan Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/households
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Uji 201: Tambah Rumah Tangga
POST {{baseUrl}}/households
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keluarga Uji Baru",
  "currency": "IDR",
  "monthly_start_day": 1
}

### 4. Uji 403: Ubah Rumah Tangga oleh BUKAN Ayah (Misal: Ibu/Anak)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/households/{{household_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_ibu}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nama yang Diubah Ibu"
}

### 5. Uji 200: Hapus Rumah Tangga (Soft Delete oleh Ayah)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/households/{{household_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

